' '--task' 'fixture-20261014-1' '--attempt' '83e514d2-8f8a-433b-be96-6c035f512380' '--session' '11d92827-c232-46f7-b45c-67f096071ab3' '--fence' '1' '--spec-rev' '1' '--commit' 'FULL_COMMIT_SHA'\n本会话的 CLI 会将 submit、status、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。"}},{"seq":24,"time":"2026-10-14T04:53:39.859Z","task":"fixture-20261014-1","attempt":"83e514d2-8f8a-433b-be96-6c035f512380","type":"dispatched","details":{"attempt":{"task_id":"fixture-20261014-1","attempt_id":"83e514d2-8f8a-433b-be96-6c035f512380","session_id":"11d92827-c232-46f7-b45c-67f096071ab3","fence":1,"spec_rev":1,"thread_id":"52edac47-b4a4-4baf-a693-7f38a1c37371","runtime_mode":"workspace-write","turn_id":null,"runtime_identity":{"launch":"0324f2a9-6cfb-4585-b521-120004ec430f","thread":"52edac47-b4a4-4baf-a693-7f38a1c37371","shell_pid":31000,"leader_pid":31001,"native_session":"fixture-native-0324f2a9-6cfb-4585-b521-120004ec430f"},"workspace":"/private/tmp/q76-qi22zh6u/c-ayw61pqh/state/worktrees/fixture/fixture-20261014-1-a1","base_commit":"c77cb16f107748845f8af64eb06a6474bf38fa93","card_snapshot_id":"833e6c0c-aa49-4a0f-ab0a-4a2c3e16d342","reclaimed":false,"owner":"fixture-20261014-1","state":"claimed"}}},{"seq":25,"time":"2026-10-14T04:53:41.030Z","task":"fixture-20261014-1","attempt":"83e514d2-8f8a-433b-be96-6c035f512380","type":"command_intent","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/private/tmp/q76-qi22zh6u/c-ayw61pqh/repo","cat-file","-t","cb828b9ebea7832d486c66c58d6b456877305586"],"cwd":"/private/tmp/q76-qi22zh6u/c-ayw61pqh/repo"}},{"seq":26,"time":"2026-10-14T04:53:41.035Z","task":"fixture-20261014-1","attempt":"83e514d2-8f8a-433b-be96-6c035f512380","type":"command_result","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/private/tmp/q76-qi22zh6u/c-ayw61pqh/repo","cat-file","-t","cb828b9ebea7832d486c66c58d6b456877305586"],"cwd":"/private/tmp/q76-